<header class="top"><a class="mobile-brand" href="/" aria-label="SAIFNEX home"><img src="/saifnex-logo.png" alt="SAIFNEX" width="150" height="50" style="display:block;width:150px;max-width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain"></a><div class="crumb">Workspace <span style="padding:0 8px;color:#4f6281">/</span><b>Overview</b></div><div class="top-right"><span class="demo-pill"><i class="dot"></i> PREVIEW MODE</span>@auth<form method="POST" action="{{ route('logout') }}" style="margin:0">@csrf<button class="iconbtn" type="submit" aria-label="Sign out" title="Sign out">↪</button></form>@else<a class="iconbtn" href="{{ route('login') }}" aria-label="Sign in" title="Sign in" style="display:grid;place-items:center">↗</a>@endauth</div></header>
<div class="content">
<div class="pagehead"><div><div class="eyebrow">Network intelligence</div><h1>Good to see you here.</h1><p>Your network operations, designed to be easier to understand.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#platform">Explore platform <span>↗</span></a></div>
<div class="notice"><div class="notice-icon">ⓘ</div><div><b>This is a UI preview — not connected to live networks.</b><p>Values are placeholders and no network activity is being collected here. Sign-in, live metrics, and management actions will be connected in the next implementation phase.</p></div></div>
<section class="stats" aria-label="Illustrative metrics">
<div class="stat"><div class="stat-top"><span>Managed networks</span><span class="stat-icon">⌘</span></div><div class="stat-value">—</div><div class="stat-foot">Connect a network to begin</div></div>
<div class="stat"><div class="stat-top"><span>Edge nodes</span><span class="stat-icon">▤</span></div><div class="stat-value">—</div><div class="stat-foot">Awaiting node enrollment</div></div>
<div class="stat"><div class="stat-top"><span>Policy profiles</span><span class="stat-icon">☷</span></div><div class="stat-value">—</div><div class="stat-foot">Configure policy intent</div></div>
<div class="stat"><div class="stat-top"><span>Pending deployments</span><span class="stat-icon">⇧</span></div><div class="stat-value">—</div><div class="stat-foot">No live deployment data</div></div>
</section>
<div class="dashboard-grid">
<div class="left-col">
<section class="panel" id="activity"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Network activity</h2><div class="panel-sub">Illustrative visualization · no live telemetry</div></div><span class="status neutral">PREVIEW</span></div><div class="chart-area"><svg viewBox="0 0 600 190" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative network activity chart"><defs><linearGradient id="fillBlue" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#4a8aff" stop-opacity=".22"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4a8aff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs><path class="gridline" d="M0 20H600M0 60H600M0 100H600M0 140H600M0 180H600"/><path d="M0 150 35 132 70 142 105 91 140 106 175 70 210 92 245 57 280 78 315 42 350 65 385 35 420 54 455 26 490 47 525 20 560 40 600 18V190H0Z" fill="url(#fillBlue)"/><path class="line-blue" d="M0 150 35 132 70 142 105 91 140 106 175 70 210 92 245 57 280 78 315 42 350 65 385 35 420 54 455 26 490 47 525 20 560 40 600 18"/><path class="line-cyan" d="M0 163 35 155 70 161 105 139 140 148 175 122 210 135 245 111 280 125 315 104 350 118 385 93 420 110 455 81 490 98 525 72 560 84 600 63"/></svg><div class="empty-chart">Illustration only · connect a node to display actual telemetry</div></div><div class="legend"><span><i></i>Traffic volume (sample)</span><span><i class="cyan"></i>Policy events (sample)</span></div></section>
<section class="panel" id="nodes"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Edge node readiness</h2><div class="panel-sub">What the node lifecycle will surface</div></div><a href="#deployments">Deployment flow ↗</a></div><div class="list"><div class="listrow"><div class="row-icon">⌁</div><div class="row-main"><b>Node enrollment</b><span>Register a node and issue a one-time credential</span></div><span class="status neutral">PLANNED UI</span></div><div class="listrow"><div class="row-icon">✓</div><div class="row-main"><b>Heartbeat &amp; health</b><span>Track last contact and operational state</span></div><span class="status neutral">PLANNED UI</span></div><div class="listrow"><div class="row-icon">⛨</div><div class="row-main"><b>Configuration verification</b><span>Reject unsigned or mismatched snapshots</span></div><span class="status pending">SIGNING DEPENDENCY</span></div></div></section>
</div>
<div class="right-col">
<section class="panel" id="policies"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Policy workspace</h2><div class="panel-sub">Manage intent, not complexity</div></div></div><div class="policy-row"><div><b>Protection profiles</b><span>Reusable policy templates</span></div><span class="status neutral">READY TO BUILD</span></div><div class="policy-row"><div><b>Rules &amp; schedules</b><span>Control when rules apply</span></div><span class="status neutral">API FOUNDATION</span></div><div class="policy-row"><div><b>Validate &amp; publish</b><span>Review before configuration changes</span></div><span class="status pending">SIGNING REQUIRED</span></div><div class="policy-footer"><a href="/#architecture">Review platform architecture →</a></div></section>
<section class="panel" id="deployments"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Deployment lifecycle</h2><span class="status neutral">OVERVIEW</span></div></div><div class="list"><div class="listrow"><div class="row-icon">01</div><div class="row-main"><b>Generate &amp; validate</b><span>Check schema and policy intent</span></div></div><div class="listrow"><div class="row-icon">02</div><div class="row-main"><b>Sign &amp; publish</b><span>Establish a trusted configuration envelope</span></div></div><div class="listrow"><div class="row-icon">03</div><div class="row-main"><b>Deploy &amp; acknowledge</b><span>Verify on node and retain recovery state</span></div></div></div></section>
</div>
</div>
<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Continue building</h2><div class="panel-sub">Shortcuts to the next platform areas</div></div></div><div class="quicklinks"><a class="quicklink" href="/#platform"><div class="qicon">⌘</div><div><b>Network management</b><span>Network and membership experience</span></div></a><a class="quicklink" href="/#capabilities"><div class="qicon">☷</div><div><b>Policy management</b><span>Rules, profiles, and schedules</span></div></a><a class="quicklink" href="/#architecture"><div class="qicon">⛨</div><div><b>Trusted edge runtime</b><span>Configuration and node lifecycle</span></div></a></div></section>
<p class="footnote">SAIFNEX Control Center Preview · All charts and indicators are illustrative until connected to authenticated backend data.</p>
